' A v1.2 human who dies on the map keeps his next turn (`preset classic ai
' none seed 3 start 2`): he starts in Death Town, gas 95, unprotected, and
' dies at the first day's end. In that turn he goes into his place:
' `LocationScene`'s `Player.Update` sets `IsDead` once the death animation
' has played (`Player.cs:338-346`) and the turn ends (`LocationScene.cs:
' 555-559`); the next `World.Turn` then takes its `else` branch
' (`World.cs:120-126`) and dismisses nobody: an `out` line, no `defeat`.
' Compare `v12_dead_turn_next`.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
day                      ' dies at the day's end
wait 30
mapclick 265,349         ' into Death Town, in his own turn
wait 60
quit
